 ## Unreleased
 
+- `contains` rules match whole words only; the new `anywhere` match kind keeps the old
+  behaviour of matching inside words.
 - Payees are stored in upper case with runs of spaces collapsed, so differently spelt
   statements group under one payee.
 - `import --dry-run` shows what a statement would add without storing anything.
